ove the standard class names. Use data attributes for targeted styling instead."},"711":{"id":"/docs/components/icon-72","page_id":"/docs/components/icon","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/icon#data-attributes","content":"The component automatically adds data attributes for styling hooks:"},"712":{"id":"/docs/components/icon-73","page_id":"/docs/components/icon","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/icon#data-attributes","content":"`data-icon`: The icon name (always present)"},"713":{"id":"/docs/components/icon-74","page_id":"/docs/components/icon","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/icon#data-attributes","content":"`data-color`: Applied when color prop is set"},"714":{"id":"/docs/components/icon-75","page_id":"/docs/components/icon","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/icon#data-attributes","content":"`data-loading`: Applied during icon loading from CDN"},"715":{"id":"/docs/components/icon-76","page_id":"/docs/components/icon","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/icon#data-attributes","content":"`data-mode`: Applied when mode prop is set (e.g., \"sprite\")"},"716":{"id":"/docs/components/icon-77","page_id":"/docs/components/icon","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/icon#data-attributes","content":"`data-flip`: Applied when flip prop is set (\"horizontal\" or \"vertical\")"},"717":{"id":"/docs/components/icon-78","page_id":"/docs/components/icon","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/icon#data-attributes","content":"`data-rotate`: Applied when rotate prop is set (90, 180, or 270)"},"718":{"id":"/docs/components/icon-79","page_id":"/docs/components/icon","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/icon#data-attributes","content":"The component also includes accessibility attributes:"},"719":{"id":"/docs/components/icon-80","page_id":"/docs/components/icon","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/icon#data-attributes","content":"`role=\"presentation\"`: For decorative icons"},"720":{"id":"/docs/components/icon-81","page_id":"/docs/components/icon","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/icon#data-attributes","content":"`role=\"img\"`: When title prop is provided"},"721":{"id":"/docs/components/icon-82","page_id":"/docs/components/icon","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/icon#data-attributes","content":"`focusable=\"false\"`: Prevents keyboard focus"},"722":{"id":"/docs/components/icon-83","page_id":"/docs/components/icon","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/icon#inherit-from-parent-default","content":"By default, icons inherit the color from their parent element via `currentColor`:"},"723":{"id":"/docs/components/icon-84","page_id":"/docs/components/icon","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/icon#explicit-colors","content":"Override the color with specific values:"},"724":{"id":"/docs/components/icon-85","page_id":"/docs/components/icon","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/icon#icon-transformations","content":"Transform capabilities are inherited from the Bento Illustration component. For complete transformation options and implementation details, see the `@bento/illustration` package documentation."},"725":{"id":"/docs/components/icon-86","page_id":"/docs/components/icon","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/icon#rotation","content":"Rotate icons by 90-degree increments:"},"726":{"id":"/docs/components/icon-87","page_id":"/docs/components/icon","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/icon#flipping","content":"Flip icons horizontally or vertically:"},"727":{"id":"/docs/components/icon-88","page_id":"/docs/components/icon","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/icon#placeholder-content","content":"Provide fallback SVG content while icons load from the CDN:"},"728":{"id":"/docs/components/icon-89","page_id":"/docs/components/icon","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/icon#decorative-icons","content":"For purely decorative icons, no additional attributes are needed. The icon will have `role=\"presentation\"` and be ignored by screen readers:"},"729":{"id":"/docs/components/icon-90","page_id":"/docs/components/icon","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/icon#semantic-icons","content":"For icons that convey meaning, use the `title` prop. This automatically adds `role=\"img\"` and provides screen reader accessible text:"},"730":{"id":"/docs/components/icon-91","page_id":"/docs/components/icon","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/icon#interactive-icons","content":"For interactive icons within buttons or links, use the `title` prop on the icon and `aria-label` on the interactive element:"},"731":{"id":"/docs/components/icon-92","page_id":"/docs/components/icon","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/icon#default-icon-loading","content":"Icons are loaded on-demand from a CDN using the following process:"},"732":{"id":"/docs/components/icon-93","page_id":"/docs/components/icon","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/icon#default-icon-loading","content":"**First Request**: When an icon is first encountered, it triggers an asynchronous fetch from the CDN"},"733":{"id":"/docs/components/icon-94","page_id":"/docs/components/icon","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/icon#default-icon-loading","content":"**SVG Parsing**: The fetched SVG string is parsed into a React element using `@bento/svg-parser`"},"734":{"id":"/docs/components/icon-95","page_id":"/docs/components/icon","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/icon#default-icon-loading","content":"**Automatic Caching**: Once loaded, the icon is cached in memory to avoid subsequent network requests"},"735":{"id":"/docs/components/icon-96","page_id":"/docs/components/icon","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/icon#default-icon-loading","content":"**Full SVG Rendering**: Each icon instance renders as a complete SVG element with all path data"},"736":{"id":"/docs/components/icon-97","page_id":"/docs/components/icon","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/icon#default-icon-loading","content":"This approach works well for SSR and small numbers of icons, but can lead to DOM bloat when the same icon appears many times."},"737":{"id":"/docs/components/icon-98","page_id":"/docs/components/icon","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/icon#sprite-mode-optimization","content":"When `mode=\"sprite\"` is enabled, the component switches to a more efficient rendering strategy:"},"738":{"id":"/docs/components/icon-99","page_id":"/docs/components/icon","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/icon#sprite-mode-optimization","content":"**What happens with sprite mode:**"},"739":{"id":"/docs/components/icon-100","page_id":"/docs/components/icon","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/icon#sprite-mode-optimization","content":"**Sprite Sheet Creation**: A hidden SVG sprite sheet is automatically injected into the DOM containing symbol definitions"},"740":{"id":"/docs/components/icon-101","page_id":"/docs/components/icon","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/icon#sprite-mode-optimization","content":"**Reference Rendering**: Each icon renders as a lightweight `<use>` element that references the sprite"},"741":{"id":"/docs/components/icon-102","page_id":"/docs/components/icon","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/icon#sprite-mode-optimization","content":"**Deduplication**: Icon path data only exists once in the sprite sheet, regardless of how many times it's used"},"742":{"id":"/docs/components/icon-103","page_id":"/docs/components/icon","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/icon#sprite-mode-optimization","content":"**Client-Side Hydration**: The sprite sheet is generated and injected after hydration, causing a brief paint event"},"743":{"id":"/docs/components/icon-104","page_id":"/docs/components/icon","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/icon#sprite-mode-optimization","content":"**DOM Output:**"},"744":{"id":"